          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "Method: A concept mapping procedure was used, following four consecutive steps. The first step was brainstorming which was conducted through Microsoft Teams. This step resulted in a list of statements. The second step was an online computer assignment in which participants had to rate and sort the gathered statements. The third step was a statistical analysis resulting in a concept map and clusterlist. The fourth step was an expertmeeting to interpret the concept map and clusterlist. The expertmeeting was also conducted through Microsoft Teams.\n  Universe: The group of people were adult men and women with a mild to borderline intellectual disability from the Netherlands."
          },
